# DriveBackupV2
# Automatic server backups to Google Drive / OneDrive / Dropbox / FTP / S3
# Supports Minecraft 1.8 - 1.21.x
#
# Download:
# - Modrinth / CurseForge / SpigotMC
# - GitHub: https://github.com/MaxMaeder/DriveBackupV2
# - Spigot: https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/drivebackupv2.79519/
#
# Place the .jar file in this folder.
# After first start use: /drivebackup linkaccount googledrive (or onedrive/dropbox)
